      "text": "power and the might of mine hand hath gotten me this wealth, Deut. 8:17. They that trust in their wealth, Ps. 49:6. perish, and leave their wealth to others, Ps. 49:10. Lest strangers be filled with thy wealth, Prov. 5:10. rich man’s wealth is his strong city, Prov. 10:15 (18:11). Wealth gotten by vanity shall be diminished, Prov. 13:11. wealth of the sinner is laid up for the just, Prov. 13:22. Wealth maketh many friends, Prov. 19:4. man to whom God hath given riches, wealth, Eccl. 6:2.",
